"timeout": 30}}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-terra", "usage": {"input": 49716, "output": 1168, "cacheRead": 47616, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 456, "totalTokens": 98500, "cost": {"input": 0, "output": 0, "cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0}}, "stopReason": "toolUse", "timestamp": 1789138731844, "responseId": "resp_0858abb99b3001e2016aa4172c2ad887d29db7c3b1b0e78497", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": [{"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_glh1MlohKXJ4dkOVKZqHT2Ga|fc_0858abb99b3001e2016aa41742a8f087d2bf6728d5898dec6e", "toolName": "read", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "## Human intervention needed\n\nThe automated job failed for `org.springframework.integration:spring-integration-sftp:7.1.1`. Preserved work: https://github.com/oracle/graalvm-reachability-metadata/tree/ai%2Fkimeta%2Fhuman-intervention%2Fissue-9952-library-new-request-org.springframework.integration-spring-integration-sftp-7.1.1-52686522\n\nAlthough reported as `test_generation_failed`, the persistent blocker is `nativeTestCompile`. After two JVM-test corrections, the JVM tests passed, but Native Image repeatedly aborted before test execution because Apache MINA SSHD 2.18.0 filesystem-provider objects (`RootedFileSystemProvider` and `SftpFileSystemProviderFacade`) were placed in the image heap while configured for runtime initialization. The same failure occurred during the initial dynamic-access run with the original placeholder test, indicating a dependency/toolchain compatibility issue rather than a generated-test defect.\n\nThe run exhausted 12 iterations. Metrics record identical starting and ending commits, `generated_loc: 0`, `metadata_entries: 0`, and unavailable coverage; consequently, the preserved source remains the placeholder test and the metadata file is empty.\n\nInspect:\n- `logs/org.springframework.integration:spring-integration-sftp:7.1.1/add-new-library-support/pi-generation-2026-09-09T19-28-04-630879Z.log`\n- `logs/org.springframework.integration:spring-integration-sftp:7.1.1/gradle-test/gradle-test-2026-09-09T19-40-34-914143Z.log`\n- `logs/org.springframework.integration:spring-integration-sftp:7.1.1/dynamic-access-report/generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport-2026-09-09T19-23-52-734684Z.log`\n\nManual next steps:\n1. Reproduce `nativeTestCompile` on the supported GraalVM/JDK matrix and determine whether this is specific to the logged GraalVM 25.1.0-dev build.\n2. Trace the Apache SSHD provider instantiation and pursue a compliant GraalVM, Apache SSHD, or harness/classpath resolution; do not use the suggested `--initialize-at-build-time` workaround because repository policy forbids build-time-initialization tweaks.\n3. Once native compilation succeeds, replace the placeholder with meaningful SFTP tests, regenerate metadata and coverage, and run the full coordinate-scoped validation.\n"}], "isError": false, "timestamp": 1789138755494}, {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_sC6ER8vQGLWzAUm0yhvYJurA|fc_0858abb99b3001e2016aa41742a90487d2bac8323bdd9e6d49", "toolName": "read", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Command: ./gradlew generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport -Pcoordinates=org.springframework.integration:spring-integration-sftp:7.1.1\nWorking directory: /home/mihailo/git/graalvm-reachability-metadata-copy/forge/local_repositories/forge_worktrees/9952-d01c0627\n\n--- output ---\n> Task :tck-build-logic:extractPluginRequests UP-TO-DATE\n> Task :tck-build-logic:generatePluginAdapters UP-TO-DATE\n> Task :tck-build-logic:compileJava UP-TO-DATE\n> Task :tck-build-logic:compileGroovy UP-TO-DATE\n> Task :tck-build-logic:compileGroovyPlugins UP-TO-DATE\n> Task :tck-build-logic:pluginDescriptors UP-TO-DATE\n> Task :tck-build-logic:processResources UP-TO-DATE\n> Task :tck-build-logic:classes UP-TO-DATE\n> Task :tck-build-logic:jar UP-TO-DATE\n\n> Configure project :\nGraalVM Reachability Metadata TCK\n---------------------------------\n\n> Task :generateDynamicAcce